const api=async(url,opt={})=>{const controller=new AbortController();const timer=setTimeout(()=>controller.abort(),12000);try{const r=await fetch(url,{...opt,signal:controller.signal,headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json',...(opt.headers||{})},credentials:'same-origin'});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error||'Request failed');return d}catch(e){if(e?.name==='AbortError')throw Error('Request timed out. Please retry.');throw e}finally{clearTimeout(timer)}};
function setMode(m){mode=m;$('loginTab').classList.toggle('active',m==='login');$('registerTab').classList.toggle('active',m==='register');$('forgotTab').classList.toggle('active',m==='forgot');$('secretWrap').classList.toggle('hidden',m!=='register');$('authSubmit').textContent=m==='login'?'Sign in securely':m==='register'?'Create private ledger':'How to reset';$('password').autocomplete=m==='login'?'current-password':'new-password';$('password').required=m!=='forgot';$('password').closest('label').classList.toggle('hidden',m==='forgot');$('password').placeholder='At least 10 characters';$('authMsg').textContent=m==='forgot'?'Passwords are reset by the account owner. Ask the owner to set a new password for your email, then sign in.':''}
